  <participating-org role="4" type="24">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OKOA NEW GENERATION (ONG) is a, transparent, accountable and Community-led non-profit organization in Tanzania. The organization isregistered in Tanzania May, 2014 under the Non-Governmental Organization Act, 2002, with the registration number 00NGO/0000708. ONG#s overall goal is to sustainably improve the standard of living of the local communities with more focus on youth, Women and PWDs.

OKOA centers its development approach around active community participation and partners with both local and international organizations to ensure institutional strengthening, capacity building and sustainable development. Since our founding in 2014.

OKOA NEW GENERATION vision is to envisages a just, democratic and inclusive society, free from poverty, with theMission to promote inclusive socio-economic empowerment and right-based participation of the marginalized youths, women, children and People with Disabilities for sustainable development.

Okoa New Generation has closely working relationship with targetbeneficiary since its inception, The establishment of youth platform including PWDs at the local level ONG has positioned its self as a referral for youth issues and championfor empowerment of youth and person with disabilities, hence youth and PWDs become closely with organization

Since the beginning OKOA has been forefront to implement the project which aim to mobilize, empower, safeguard and promote the rights of person with disabilities, girls and youth at local and national level, this create anopportunity for organization to know their challenges, gaps andcrucial information regarding the development hence create a strong relationship with the target beneficiaries

Also, during the planning and designing of its program activities the organization has always involves the target beneficiary, and therefore creates friendship and build a strong relationship,
The organization also has good working relationship with youth and PWDs network and coalition which provide a space for interaction and sharing knowledges on the development of person with disabilities, youth and their needs</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OKOA NEW GENERATION</narrative>
